shuh

It is super hacky, but it works.

Installation
------------

- Install piper(https://github.com/rhasspy/piper)
- Create a bookmarklet using https://chimurai.github.io/bookmarklet/ with the code from script.js

Usage
-----

- Run go package: `go run main.go` as a service in background
- Click on the bookmarklet to start speaking

